WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
This guide shows the complete pre-recorded workflow, from Admin preparation to a private Preview signal.

00:07.000 --> 00:16.000
Before opening Studio, complete the default live information in Missionnaire Admin. The quick private test reuses those details.

00:16.000 --> 00:30.000
In Service setup, choose Pre-recorded Kinyarwanda, then connect the opening music, sermon recording, closing music, visual, and timed subtitle file. Continue only when everything is ready.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Open Live session and choose Quick private test. Studio creates an unlisted link using the Admin defaults and does not notify subscribers.

00:40.000 --> 00:53.000
Select Start Preview Signal and review preflight. Fix every blocked check. Review warnings, then wait for FPS, destinations, and stream health to become stable.

00:53.000 --> 01:03.000
Preview is not public. Check the private link, never choose Go Live during rehearsal, then stop streaming when the test is complete.
